<title>USA: World Bank lends Tunisia 452.8 mln French francs.</title>
<headline>World Bank lends Tunisia 452.8 mln French francs.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The World Bank has approved a loan of 452.8 million French francs to help Tunisia's municipal credit agency lend money to improve the infrastructure of urban areas, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The statement said the loan would help fund construction of roads, street lighting and drinking water and sewage systems, as well as financing training and technical help to the municipal development agency and local government.</p>
</text>
